# Orchestrator shortcuts

When the user says any of: `Orchestrator mode`, `Run T-XXX`, `continue`, `Planner only`, `Dev T-XXX`, `Test T-XXX`:

1. Follow `docs/agents/orchestrator/SYSTEM.md` and `PLAYBOOK.md`.
2. Also follow shared-context, workflow, and the role SYSTEM/PLAYBOOK files as needed.
3. Announce `## Role: Planner|Developer|Tester` at every step.
4. One ticket at a time. Do not mark `done` until Tester passes.
5. On bare `Run T-XXX` → full loop. On `continue` → next ready `todo` in backlog.
6. On `Planner only` / `Dev` / `Test` → that role only.
7. On block (missing SDK, ambiguous AC) → stop and ask.

Short command reference: `docs/agents/SHORTCUTS.md`.
